{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in the smoke-filled alleys of a city drowning in secrets, Obsidian Moon is a <strong>text-based detective adventure rooted in 1930s noir and psychological tension</strong>. Players take on the role of Sam Carter, a once-respected homicide detective haunted by grief and failure, tasked with solving a series of interconnected murders through logic, instinct, and the steady collapse of his own sanity. Armed with vintage forensics, gritty intuition, and limited time, you\u2019ll follow leads, interrogate suspects, and make costly choices that may bring you closer to the truth, or break you entirely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Gameplay Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10 Intricate murder cases</strong> that interconnect into a larger plot involving a sinister cult that aims to resurrect an ancient dark entity, plus\u00a0Optional side cases that reveal the key backstories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A haunting mystery</strong> - Psychological and chthonic horror inspired by the works of H.P. Lovecraft and the mythologies of the Mediterranean Sea cultures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Detective tools &amp; abilities</strong> - Inspect clues, conduct surveillance, or even use a fully equipped 1930s forensics lab.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Player-driven investigation \u2013 </strong>interrogate witnesses, run forensic reports, dig into criminal records\u2026 or use your magnum to extract a confession (seriously don't do this).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/2971007bb889474912d3b4cfa1efed13.poster.avif?t=1771425705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/2971007bb889474912d3b4cfa1efed13.webm?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/2971007bb889474912d3b4cfa1efed13.mp4?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful choices -</strong> Your conduct counts. Build cases through methodical evidence collection, burn time and money on risky leads, use costly surveillance operations and questionable tactics to get what you want. Put your sanity at risk, or don't - its your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Genre-bending Investigation system\u00a0</strong>- A fusion of card-based mechanics like <i>Stacklands, and Cultist Simulator</i>, economy elements like <i>Papers, Please</i>\u00a0and classic Point &amp; Click adventure puzzle-solving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/ed28d9031d20fbc7f887902097337384.poster.avif?t=1771425705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/ed28d9031d20fbc7f887902097337384.webm?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/ed28d9031d20fbc7f887902097337384.mp4?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three game modes</strong> - From story mode to a hardcore permadeath detective challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noir Mode</strong> \u2013 Switch to a classic black &amp; white graphics mode for a more immersive experience.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/65541322f05c080ee74392f0bfa2b8a4.poster.avif?t=1771425705\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/65541322f05c080ee74392f0bfa2b8a4.webm?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/extras/65541322f05c080ee74392f0bfa2b8a4.mp4?t=1771425705\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201c\u2026when the shadows devour the moon, SHE will rise again\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462170?t=1771425705","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3462170?t=1771425705","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/854e23dd1520f928a06f0ddcc944a02bd930e87d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771425705","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/854e23dd1520f928a06f0ddcc944a02bd930e87d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771425705","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages such as text descriptions of violent crimes."},"demos":[{"appid":4270880,"description":"