X:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Lost Cabinet Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Linguagem impr\u00f3pria\nMedo","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Alkohol / Tabak\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte\n\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"To be announced"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cI\u2019m keen to don my trench coat and magnifying glass once more when it releases in full later this year\u201d<br>Rock Paper Shotgun<br><br>\u201cIn a world filled with games that only give you the illusion of choice, Obsidian Moon gives you full control over how you go about solving the case and how you spend your time.\u201d<br>DualSHOCKERS<br><br>\u201cI'm looking forward to seeing where this story will lead when more cases and the full game become available. All I can say is I'm kind of hooked for now\u201d<br>alt/char<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/79b3e8e62c66c4f266f4fddd80c8351f1ddfeeae/ss_79b3e8e62c66c4f266f4fddd80c8351f1ddfeeae.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771425705","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/79b3e8e62c66c4f266f4fddd80c8351f1ddfeeae/ss_79b3e8e62c66c4f266f4fddd80c8351f1ddfeeae.600x338.jpg?t=1771425705"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/4ebab06406c9f60255108561778611e763376a3d/ss_4ebab06406c9f60255108561778611e763376a3d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1771425705","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3462170/4ebab06406c9f60255108561778611e763376a3d/ss_4ebab06406c9f60255108561778611e763376a3d.600x338.jpg?t=1771425705"},